{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/05/oo10_2.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな皆さんへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のコメント、\n温かい言葉、\n1つ1つ読ませていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうもありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに号泣してしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私らしくて、いいんだって\nそう思うことができました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんからパワー\nもらってばっかりだね(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかお返しできるように、\n前を向いて頑張ります( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気が出て右手でブログ書いてたら、\n左手で肘をこすってた(⌒-⌒; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これが私の癖です…笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金曜日から\n学校の第四回考査があります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昭和loveですが\n大正から前の古典にあたる部分は\n苦手でございます(T_T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして情報は\n前回98点という高得点だったのですが、\n今回は手もつけてません(T_T)\n理由：範囲がわからない…。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも笑顔で乗り切ろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポジティブヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良い暗記方法があれば\n教えて欲しいなぁ\\(//∇//)\\"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------------------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっと、私からは\n鼻うがいの方法を教えちゃいます！\n(ごめん…なんかごめんなさい！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.コップにぬるま湯を入れて、\n『ちょっとしょっぱいなぁ』\n程度の塩を入れる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.口に含んで、まずは普通に\n『ガラガラペッ』ってする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.また1を口に含んで\n今度は鼻から出す。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わり！\n3がちょっと難しいかなぁ～…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特訓あるのみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、本当に風邪やインフルエンザ、\nマイコプラズマにも気をつけて下さい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"身体を温めて！\n足から冷えますからね(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私で良ければ温めますよ(*^^*)？\n(みんな、逃げて！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふふっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シュッシュッシュ\n摩擦熱よ、皆さんに届け～\\(//∇//)\\"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい…(T_T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当、みんなが大好きです。\nおやすみなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山一実"}],"source":"archive"}